  "title": "GPM IMERG Early and Final Half-Hourly Precipitation Datasets",
  "description": "Global Precipitation Measurement (GPM) IMERG Early and Final Run half-hourly global precipitation estimates, derived from multi-satellite retrievals and stored as Zarr arrays. Coverage is global at 30-minute temporal resolution, with the Early run providing near-real-time estimates and the Final run providing a research-quality, latency-adjusted product.",
